{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azizi-central","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-central-al-furjan","about":"Azizi Central is the epitome of luxury living in the heart of Dubai, built by Azizi Developments and offering luxury 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments. The spacious flats feature thoughtfully designed layouts to maximise space and natural light. All apartments feature high quality finishes and fixtures, creating a harmonious blend of style and functionality.To ensure a comfortable living experience, the complex offers a range of exclusive amenities and services. Residents can relax in the state-of-the-art spa centre, unwind in the infinity pool with breathtaking views or maintain an active lifestyle in the fully equipped fitness centre. For those looking for entertainment, there is a dedicated cinema room - the perfect place to watch your favourite films with friends and family. The complex also features recreational areas, lush landscaped gardens and a dedicated children's play area.One of the main advantages of the complex is its prime location, offering stunning exclusive views of the Dubai skyline. With its proximity to major attractions, business districts and entertainment centres, residents have easy access to all that Dubai has to offer.","price":1272000,"title":"Azizi Central","bitrix":{"id":584,"pf_id":"are.2.13396","source":null,"project_id":"Azizi Central","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/353/images/2023/07/20/340x252/GR7nycuU6p5SXmfFcRHmAb0EQ8CORG66ntIG1Lw1.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/353/images/2023/07/20/464x312/GR7nycuU6p5SXmfFcRHmAb0EQ8CORG66ntIG1Lw1.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.02587,"lng":55.157326},"country"